firebase_analytics_dart
Copyright 2018 Razvan Lung (long1eu) and contributors.

This package is an unofficial client of the Google Analytics 4 Measurement
Protocol with the API shape of Firebase Analytics. Its wire format follows
Google's Measurement Protocol documentation and its public API follows the
Firebase JavaScript SDK (https://github.com/firebase/firebase-js-sdk, Apache
License 2.0); it is not a port of a Firebase SDK.

